    "text": "Ic seah in healle hring gyldenne men sceawian, modum gleawe, fer\u00fe\u00feum frode.\nFri\u00feospede b\u00e6d god nergende g\u00e6ste sinum se \u00fee wende wri\u00fean; word \u00e6fter cw\u00e6\u00f0 hring on hyrede,\nHim torhte in gemynd his dryhtnes naman dumba brohte ond in eagna gesih\u00f0, gif \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6\u00feelan goldes\nNe m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6re bene \u00e6niges monnes ungefullodre godes ealdorburg g\u00e6st gesecan, rodera ceastre.\nR\u00e6de, se \u00fee wille, hu \u00f0\u00e6s wr\u00e6tlican wunda cw\u00e6den hringes to h\u00e6le\u00feum, \u00fea he in healle w\u00e6s wylted",
